OL,3,GNEWSABingo firm seeks extra approval
OL,4,Afor empty shop plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bingo company previously given
OL,7,Fapproval to convert a former city
OL,8,Fcentre shop is seeking more permission
OL,9,Fto progress its plan.
OL,11,FClub 3000 said its scheme to transform
OL,12,Fthe former TK Maxx unit at The Bridges
OL,13,FShopping Centre in Sunderland, which
OL,14,Fwas approved in October, would create
OL,15,Fabout 40 new jobs.
OL,17,FNow the firm has lodged a second
OL,18,Fapplication with Sunderland City
OL,19,FCouncil seeking to make external
OL,20,Fchanges to the building.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
